[I] Simple daemon to control fan speed on MacBooks, other macs

[T] mbpfan is a daemon that reads the processor temperatures from the
[T] coretemp kernel module and sets the fan speed of MacBooks and other
[T] Apple computers through the applesmc module. It supports any number of
[T] processors and up to 10 fans.

[U] https://github.com/linux-on-mac/mbpfan

[A] Mbpfan Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

